WEBVTT

00:00:00.007 --> 00:00:04.197
When comparing model sizes, keep the experiment stable.

00:00:04.197 --> 00:00:11.907
Use the same prompt set, the same decoding settings, and the same evaluation rubric for every candidate.

00:00:11.907 --> 00:00:19.952
The code can expose one common evaluation function even if one model runs locally and another model is reached through a

00:00:19.952 --> 00:00:27.413
remote endpoint. The point is to compare the models, not accidentally compare different test conditions.
